5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We need to verify if past projects actually met user expectations before approving new ones.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about how much disruption the construction causes to daily academic schedules.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,The current staff are already stretched thin; any new plan must account for their existing workload.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I have noticed that recent projects consistently exceed their initial timelines and budgets.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Let us ensure the numbers we approve today do not evaporate the moment we sign the check.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki, do you have specific data on which projects overran the most?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@George, if staffing is tight, how do we handle the temporary loss of rooms during renovation?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,We cannot assume extra work will be absorbed silently; it will just pile up on the same people.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, yes, the slippage is consistent across the last three cycles, not just isolated incidents.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, the hidden costs of maintenance often appear years later, not during the construction phase.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I propose we look at the actual usage data rather than just the initial proposals.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. We need to see how the rooms are actually used after the work is done.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will check the staffing records to see if we have any slack in the current team.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will investigate the delivery schedules to understand where the time is actually being lost.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will review the tender records to see if the initial bids were realistic or optimistic.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Let us focus on the post-occupancy reviews to see what the users actually think.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will look into the timetable records to quantify the disruption during the work period.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I will also check the renewal reserve to see if we have funds for unexpected repairs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I will also look at the weather days to see if external factors are delaying the work.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will also check the post-occupancy ratings to see if the quality matches the cost.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
