35,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The reviews show that shared spaces are rated much higher than isolated ones.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, that aligns with my findings. The disruption is real, but the usage is key.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"I found that we have spare technician hours, but the front-of-house posts are still empty.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, my data shows that projects justified by inspection findings are delivered on time.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, the ratings confirm that the value is in the shared use, not the specific department.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki, that is interesting. So the rationale for the project matters more than the location?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@George, if the front-of-house is empty, how do we manage the booking system for the new rooms?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Victoria, the technicians can handle the technical side, but the administrative gap is a real problem.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
