45,2,3,talk,Toshio,,We need a plan that addresses the administrative gap while focusing on shared spaces.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. The timetable disruption is manageable if we have a clear booking system in place.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,I will look into the booking data to see how the current system is being used.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
